      "text": {
        "html": "<h1 class=\"article-title custom _1\">The Slow Creator</h1>",
        "text": "The Slow Creator"
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "03bd75d5-bcf1-3393-10ec-a6d0b693f90c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": {
        "html": "<h2 class=\"article-title custom\"><strong class=\"bold-text-3\" data-w-id=\"dc2f4f4a-2dbb-5a66-b855-0bf8d2c6d710\">Notes on How to Earn More, Stress Less &amp; Keep Creating in the Age of AI</strong></h2>",
        "text": "Notes on How to Earn More, Stress Less & Keep Creating in the Age of AI"
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "909431ed-dc8e-360a-0af1-20c74577952e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": {
        "html": "<div class=\"article-rich-text\"><p data-w-id=\"647391d6-abd8-073e-b66b-5073404af474\">Hey, I’m <a data-wf-link-page-id=\"65783e15af1d447a19ae7c2d\" data-w-id=\"647391d6-abd8-073e-b66b-5073404af476\">Oleksandr Slobodskyi</a>. </p><p data-w-id=\"647391d6-abd8-073e-b66b-5073404af47b\">For more than 10 years I've been testing how creators actually earn: platforms, payments, tools, systems. </p><p data-w-id=\"ee4acbf2-1379-b7b9-12b3-5ba81931d3b5\">The wins become guides. The failures save you money.</p><p data-w-id=\"5e46edd0-eb1f-bdb8-7e93-f460cf23dd5b\">No guru energy. No hype. Just what works, documented.</p><p data-w-id=\"732411fa-a3c1-dd1e-218a-1c672d916b1f\">Occasional emails when I find something worth sharing. No schedule, no spam.</p></div>",
        "text": null
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "d49dbbe7-1334-0774-cc95-c86d2d99e4af",
      "type": "text-input",
      "placeholder": "Enter your email address",
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "d49dbbe7-1334-0774-cc95-c86d2d99e4b0",
